div class=\"space-y-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-foreground/80\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span>AC not cooling, Front suspension noise</span></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"text-xs text-secondary flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-clock\"><path d=\"M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M3 10h5\"></path><path d=\"M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg> Today, 09:30 AM</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Est: ₹12,500</div></div></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-surface-50 border border-white/5 rounded-xl hover:border-accent-rust/30 transition-colors\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\"><div><div class=\"text-lg font-display font-bold tracking-wide\">KL 07 CD 4582</div><div class=\"text-sm text-secondary\">Hyundai Creta • Rahul</div></div><div class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-accent-rust/10 border border-accent-rust/20 rounded text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-rust font-medium\">Awaiting Parts</div></div><div class=\"space-y-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-foreground/80\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span>Brake vibration during high speed</span></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center\"><div class=\"text-xs text-secondary flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-clock\"><path d=\"M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M3 10h5\"></path><path d=\"M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg> Yesterday, 14:15</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Est: ₹8,400</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-sm hover:text-primary/80 transition-colors\" href=\"#features\">See How It Works <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold uppercase text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\">Everything behind the repair.</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Vehicle Intake</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">Capture vehicle, VIN, owner, complaints, and arrival details instantly.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Repair Tracking</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">Follow every repair step from initial diagnosis to final completion.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Work Progress</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">Maintain a timestamped, immutable history of all work performed.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Cost Control</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">Separate parts and labor costs with automatic totals and clear margins.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">05</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Job Sheets</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">Generate professional, printable job sheets for technicians and customers.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 border border-white/5 bg-surface-50 hover:bg-surface-100 rounded-xl transition-all group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"font-display text-4xl text-white/10 group-hover:text-primary/30 transition-colors mb-6\">06</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider\">Workshop Overview</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed\">See the complete workshop workload, bottlenecks, and revenue in one place.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-32 relative overflow-hidden bg-background\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-20 relative z-10\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\">Nothing gets lost<br/> along the way.</h2><p class=\"text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest text-sm\">A permanent record of the repair journey.</p></div><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\"><div class=\"absolute left-[39px] md:left-[50%] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/10\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-row md:justify-center items-center gap-6 md:gap-12 relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"hidden md:block w-1/2 text-right\"><span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-wide text-foreground\">Vehicle received</span></div><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-background border-2 bo